Abstract = {The International Arid Lands Consortium was established in 1990 to
   promote research, education, and training for the development,
   management, restoration, and reclamation of arid and semi-arid lands
   throughout the world. One activity of the Consorium is supporting
   demonstration projects that lead to better management of these fragile
